# CTS Express Logistics Pvt Ltd — the white-label brand for the web app.
#
#   Docker:        docker run --env-file brands/cts.env -e AGENT_URL=http://agent:3001 -p 8080:80 rafai-web
#   Dev / static:  cp brands/cts.env .env.local && npm run dev        (or: npm run build)
#
# The logo and the tab icon are embedded below as data URLs, so this one file is
# the whole brand: nothing to mount, copy or host. The source images are in
# brands/cts/. Each line stays well under Docker's 64 KB --env-file line limit.
#
# Colours are taken from the logo. Its red (#ef1b22) is 4.1:1 against the
# page, just under the 4.5:1 the accent needs — links and tabs use the accent as
# text — so the accent is the same red a shade deeper, and a shade lighter for
# the dark theme. The bar across the top is the logo's own red. The sidebar is
# left neutral: the logo is drawn on white and sits cleanly on it.
#
# The assistant's OWN name — what it answers when asked who it is — is set on the
# agent service, as tenant "cts" in rafai-ai-agent/src/db/tenants.json.

BRAND_NAME=CTS Express AI
BRAND_COMPANY=CTS Express Logistics Pvt Ltd
BRAND_TAGLINE=Analytics
BRAND_ACCENT=e11920
BRAND_ACCENT_DARK=f13b41
BRAND_BAR=ef1b22
BRAND_LOGO_URL=data:image/jpeg;base64,
BRAND_FAVICON_URL=data:image/jpeg;base64,
